<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Kitchen Stove</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Pozer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Kitchen Stove</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7diD1MucbcRUVjS6AA9ehm</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.335" end="00:03.038">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.038" end="00:07.419">I done it with gang and I done it alone (Mmm, nah, turn that up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.419" end="00:09.777">Know my ting, bu-bu-bad to the bone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.777" end="00:13.899" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Young Madz, tur-t-t-tu-t-t—)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.899" end="00:15.399" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.161" end="00:15.661">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.568" end="00:16.965">Roll this dope, smoke and toke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.965" end="00:18.786">Southside of the water, ain’t a joke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.786" end="00:20.562">I chop green then I’m letting it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.562" end="00:22.262">My nigga put faith in a kitchen stove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.262" end="00:24.244">If it ain’t bout bread, don’t call my phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.244" end="00:26.074">If it ain’t bout progress, leave me alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.074" end="00:27.871">I done it with gang and I done it alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.871" end="00:29.631">Niggas know my ting, bu-bu-bad to the bone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.631" end="00:31.131" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.845" end="00:31.345">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.094" end="00:31.877">From a Q to a half to a 4s</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.877" end="00:33.620">I'm still in and out of the warehouse doors</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.620" end="00:35.420">I mash work, of course</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.420" end="00:37.259">It could've been or from a next source</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.259" end="00:38.759">I saw my first blade at nine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.690" end="00:41.106">At the age of twelve, slap bine, fifteen, be a court case</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.106" end="00:42.606">I flied it on the strip</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.324" end="00:44.620">It's clear mine's different to your ye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.620" end="00:46.460">In and out of these council flats</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.460" end="00:48.186">Tryna better my stacks, packs letting it fly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.186" end="00:50.095">I'm in the trap with the ramz on my lap</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.095" end="00:51.870">If I ain't got scales, I'll do it by eye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.870" end="00:53.802">Backstrap spliff on a dirty Sprite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.802" end="00:55.573">ZK ramz on a rusty spin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.573" end="00:57.353">Rollin' around but I can't see him</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.353" end="00:59.278">There's about five man in this tinted dings</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.278" end="01:01.206">Weed, whips, lean, liqour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.206" end="01:02.979">Hennessy make gyal turn stripper</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.979" end="01:04.949">Shanks, bine, peds, dingers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.949" end="01:06.759">Love my life, I'm a real hood nigga</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.759" end="01:08.648">The teeth on the ramz sliced him and his life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.648" end="01:10.496">The bine out the .9 caught man like gourmet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.496" end="01:12.371">That's like packs, but where's my Forte?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.371" end="01:14.389">I've been doing it since secondary school days</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.389" end="01:15.889">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.764" end="01:16.264">Roll this dope, smoke and toke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.002" end="01:17.853">Southside of the water, ain’t a joke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.853" end="01:19.716">I chop green then I’m letting it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.716" end="01:21.484">My nigga put faith in a kitchen stove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.484" end="01:23.323">If it ain’t bout bread, don’t call my phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.323" end="01:25.106">If it ain’t bout progress, leave me alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.106" end="01:26.875">I done it with gang and I done it alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.875" end="01:28.375">Niggas know my ting, bu-bu-bad to the bone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.324" end="01:29.824" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.534" end="01:30.034">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.749" end="01:30.626">I need bread, not clout, big figures</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.626" end="01:32.627">I want bruck-back, nines and spinnas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.627" end="01:34.360">Samurais, ZKs and flickers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.360" end="01:36.237">Live at the nine-five, I ain’t one of these niggas</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.237" end="01:37.896">Roads is real, gotta keep mine on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.896" end="01:40.088">And I know you get what you give, it’s mad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.088" end="01:41.804">Creep up stealth wid the nifteens wonky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.804" end="01:43.550">Due to tek wah the only son that she had</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.550" end="01:45.341">I'm tryna level up and do greatness</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.341" end="01:47.240">I know I made this and that's talking facts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.240" end="01:49.087">How you gonna G-check me with my stainless?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.087" end="01:50.999">The yute's brainless, how I'll ying it and dash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.999" end="01:52.835">Long time I ain't been Jummah, I'm wasted</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.835" end="01:54.335">I'm wasting time I don't have</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.281" end="01:56.433">PTSD brandishing my shavers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.433" end="01:58.440">Don't know if it's motor or jump out gang</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.440" end="02:01.368">Tried chinging up Totts, but he's popped, are you serious?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.368" end="02:02.868">Said I won't slide to his side, he's delirious</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.758" end="02:06.174">my nigga said roll this dope and cool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.174" end="02:07.843">I'm outside when this shit get serious</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.843" end="02:09.494">I ain't here cah I'm tryna look cool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.494" end="02:12.027">Mask on face like Ray Mysterious</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.027" end="02:13.527">I'm on TFL with this stainless tool</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.421" end="02:14.921">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.709" end="02:15.209">Roll this dope, smoke and toke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.100" end="02:16.890">Southside of the water, ain’t a joke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.890" end="02:18.787">I chop green then I’m letting it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.787" end="02:20.507">My nigga put faith in a kitchen stove</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.507" end="02:22.495">If it ain’t bout bread, don’t call my phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.495" end="02:24.183">If it ain’t bout progress, leave me alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.183" end="02:26.112">I done it with gang and I done it alone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.112" end="02:30.112">Niggas know my ting, bu-bu-bad to the bone</p></div></body></tt>